§ `Part 12 -- retrenchment information (s 96A)`

-- s 96A(2): "Every employer to whom the notification applies must comply with every requirement in the notification
-- concerning the furnishing to the Commissioner of information on the retrenchment of any employee by the employer."
-- Seam S12.  The notification is the Employment (Retrenchment Reporting) Notification 2019 (ea2-notification.l4);
-- whether it applies to the employer, and whether the employer met its requirement, arrive as its answers.
-- src:3991 | (2) Every employer to whom the notification applies must comply
-- src:3992 | with every requirement in the notification concerning the furnishing
-- src:3993 | to the Commissioner of information on the retrenchment of any
-- src:3994 | employee by the employer.
@ref s 96A(2) (src:3991-3994)
GIVEN `the notification applies to the employer` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the employer met every requirement in the notification concerning the furnishing of information on the retrenchment` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 96A the employer failed to comply with a requirement in the notification` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is of "Every employer to whom the notification applies"
        IF `the notification applies to the employer` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING
        IF `the notification applies to the employer` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `the employer met every requirement in the notification concerning the furnishing of information on the retrenchment` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Act says when the employer failed to comply and not when it complied
        OTHERWISE NOTHING
